   "maxH": 184,
   "page": "voicew",
   "size": 40,
   "text": "Voice on web stays inside the chat. The composer becomes the voice dock: Mel mark on the dot field, last 2 caption lines, mute \u00b7 keyboard \u00b7 End. Rail and history stay. Cards sit in the dock above the controls and stay in chat after. Ending drops the transcript into the thread.",
