  "wvCopy": {
   "fill": "orange",
   "maxH": 760,
   "page": "voicew",
   "text": "COPY NOT FROM BIJU (web only, new)\n\n\u00b7 Status line: Listening, Speaking, Needs you, Muted\n\u00b7 Send this to Sarah now? (spoken send confirm)\n\u00b7 Needs you \u00b7 say yes or tap Send\n\u00b7 Click the mic to talk again\n\u00b7 Mic ask: Allow it in the browser prompt and I start listening.\n\u00b7 Mic blocked: Your browser blocked it. Allow the microphone for Radius in your browser\u2019s site settings, then click voice again.\n\u00b7 \u21b3 How do I allow the microphone?\n\u00b7 No mic: I can\u2019t find one on this computer. Plug one in, then click voice again.\n\u00b7 \u21b3 Check again\n\nRest of the copy is the approved mobile voice copy.",
   "w": 560,
