   "page": "voicew",
   "text": "NEW (KJ, 28 Oct)\n\n\u00b7 Leave Mel chat from the rail and voice stays live in a mini dock, bottom-right, on any page.\n\u00b7 Click the dock or Open = back to Mel chat with the full dock.\n\u00b7 Needs you: dock flags it, Mel also says it. No popup.\n\u00b7 End from the dock keeps you on the page; transcript stays in the chat.\n\u00b7 Dashboard and Contacts are grey skeletons. Rail Dashboard + Contacts are now clickable in the prototype.\n\nCopy not from Biju: \"Needs you\", \"Draft ready for Sarah Reynolds\", \"Open\".",
